    "description": "Product Overview:\nThis listing includes a selection of vintage tobacco smoking pipes stored in a fitted black hard case. The pipes vary in material and design, featuring a corn cob pipe, a hand-carved block meerschaum pipe, and a rusticated briar pipe.\n\nSpecifications:\n- Corn Cob Pipe: Marked Missouri Meerschaum on the bowl\n- Meerschaum Pipe: Genuine block meerschaum with white bowl and brown stem, labeled Paykoc Imports, made in Turkey\n- Briar Pipe: Rusticated finish stamped with 'Sooloo'\n- Case: Fitted black hard case designed to hold the pipes\n\nAdditional Details:\nThe pipes show signs of use including discoloration and wear. The set is intended for collectors or enthusiasts of vintage smoking accessories.",
